      "text": "7b. alg == 'HS256'\nkey = HMAC secret (from JWK oct/'k')\nexpected = HMAC-SHA256(key, h64 + '.' + p64)\ncompare hash_equals(expected,\nb64url_decode(s64))",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
