      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7c. alg == 'RS256'\nkey = RSA public key (JWK RSA n/e\nor PEM). NEVER an HMAC key.\nexpected = RSASSA-PKCS1-v1_5-SHA256(\nkey, h64 + '.' + p64)\ncompare hash_equals(expected, sig)",
